# [The Sink](sink_relic_doc)

**One room. That is the whole ruin.**

A single enormous box, flooded to the ceiling with a thousand years of nebula settling out
of the murk, and nothing in it but what fell in. There is no piece of the Beacon here and
Storm never claimed there was - it is on the chart as a place XORN has been, which is worth
knowing when XORN is what is chasing you.

Optional, found by clue, and short by design: after four ruins of rooms-and-corridors, a
relic that is one vast space with things suspended in it should read as a different kind of
place, not a fifth dungeon.

What is in it is a salvage haul worth real money and a scrap of XORN's own traffic - the
piece of paper that shortens the last episode, if the crew has it before they fly into the
breaker's yard.

